{
  "about": "The realms of the Atlas outside the American keyframes (issue #104): the peninsula's polities from 218 BCE, Spain and Portugal, and their holdings in Europe, Africa, Asia and the Pacific. Each family is a chain of dated OpenHistoricalMap relations; each relation is drawn between its own start_date and end_date, narrowed (never widened) where `from`/`to` say so, and cut to `clip` (west, south, east, north) where OHM carries an error. Built by tools/build-atlas-eras.py into site/data/atlas-realms.json and site/public/data/atlas-realms.topo.json. Research: issue #104 (OHM survey of 2026-11-23). Not used: the relations whose ways carry CC BY-SA (Seville 2974339/2974338, Jaén 2974340, Kingdom of Granada 2974292, Valencia 2974331, Córdoba 2803889, Biscay, the principality of Asturias 2974171, Galicia 2974173/2974172), the open rings (Roman conquest 2697849, Biscay), the Carthage relations that duplicate 2849518, the 'Independent Moorish States' polygon 2697817 (it covers the Christian north-east), and the Spanish Netherlands (no geometry).",
  "gaps": [
    {
      "from": -27,
      "to": -14,
      "where": "iberia",
      "text": {
        "en": "OpenHistoricalMap has no shape for Baetica before 14 BCE.",
        "es": "OpenHistoricalMap no tiene forma para la Bética antes del 14 a. C."
      }
    },
    {
      "from": 1031,
      "to": 1232,
      "where": "iberia",
      "text": {
        "en": "No sourced border exists for the taifas, the Almoravids or the Almohads, so the Muslim south of the peninsula is left blank from 1031 to 1232.",
        "es": "No hay fronteras con fuentes para las taifas, los almorávides ni los almohades, así que el sur musulmán de la península queda en blanco de 1031 a 1232."
      }
    },
    {
      "from": 1199,
      "to": 1297,
      "where": "iberia",
      "text": {
        "en": "OpenHistoricalMap has no shape for the Kingdom of Portugal between 1199 and 1297, so none is drawn.",
        "es": "OpenHistoricalMap no tiene forma para el reino de Portugal entre 1199 y 1297, así que no se dibuja."
      }
    }
  ],
